$ enola dashboard --help
exit: 0
--- stdout
--- stderr
Usage: enola dashboard [--open] [repo_path|config_path]

Start a local dashboard for this repository. An MCP server is not required.
Use Refresh to load a newer snapshot written by Enola; the dashboard never regenerates source itself.

Options:
  --open         launch the dashboard in the default browser

The server binds to 127.0.0.1 and stays attached until Ctrl-C.
Run `enola --status` in another terminal to recover its URL.
If Safari blocks local HTTP in HTTPS-Only mode, allow this local address or use another browser.
